---
import PageLayout from "../../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---
<PageLayout title="Release Notes v1.3.0" description="What's new in TotalRecalls v1.3.0." breadcrumbs={[{ label: "Release Notes" }]}>
  <h1>Release Notes v1.3.0</h1>
  <h2>New Features</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Added Grok export support (grok.com session scanning)</li>
    <li>Added Claude web session export (no official tool required)</li>
    <li>Added multi-device sync configuration</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Improvements</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Markdown export now includes model name per message</li>
    <li>Improved JSON schema for easier import into Obsidian/Notion</li>
    <li>Export speed improved 3x for large conversations</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Fixes</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Fixed SmartScreen false positive on some Windows 11 builds</li>
    <li>Fixed timestamp parsing in Perplexity exports</li>
  </ul>
</PageLayout>
